5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should start by identifying where previous projects failed to meet expectations. I'll look into post-occupancy review ratings and survey findings in the older blocks.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with the need for data on usage. I will examine booking data for specialist and general rooms and timetable records on rooms out of service.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about the people maintaining these facilities. I'll check staffing posts since the hiring freeze and bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"To avoid further delays, I want to see the weather days in the site diaries and the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'll focus on the financial reality. I'll review tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
