50,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The candidates are A: Lab Ventilation, B: Study Commons, C: Path Network, and D: Media Center. I lean toward B for its accessibility.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Victoria,,B aligns perfectly with the booking data. It addresses the shortage of general rooms and provides bookable group spaces.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,George,,"A would help the technicians with their manual routines, but B seems less burdensome for the remaining grounds staff.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"C is too risky with the weather. A and D might slip if viewed as ""comfort"" or ""appeal"" projects. B is a safer bet.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,A is too expensive given the tender trends for mechanical plant. D lacks a renewal reserve. B is the most rational choice.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, would the Study Commons create too much new work for your staff?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"It's a conversion of an existing hall, so it's less invasive than a full build.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,George,,A conversion is manageable. It's better than adding more complex machinery that requires specialized upkeep.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It also avoids the hazardous material risks associated with deep renovations in older blocks, as it's a hall conversion.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we have a consensus forming around the most fiscally and operationally stable option.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I am satisfied with B.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I vote for B.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,George,,I can support B.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,B it is.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. B is the logical selection.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
